/P 227 0 R
/E (Youth who are experiencing  - or are at risk of - homeless may receive support for immediate needs such as housing, food, and healthcare, but often still face barriers to community involvement. Without access to community-building activities, youth may experience isolation and fewer opportunities to build durable relationships outside of institutional settings.  )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
