>>
endobj
304 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 227 0 R
/E (Many community activities require costs such as registration fees, equipment, memberships, and/or transportation. For youth experiencing housing instability or financial hardship, these costs serve as barriers to participation. Partner discussions  suggest youth-serving organizations often lack discretionary funding for community-building activities.  )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
