/P 227 0 R
/E (The goal of the YCCF is to reduce financial barriers to community participation. This supports youth in the development of durable relationships, routines, confidence, transferable skills, and a stronger sense of belonging in their community.  )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
