/P 227 0 R
/E (The proposed pilot would support youth aged 16-24 who are experiencing homelessness, housing instability, financial difficulty, or a heightened risk of homelessness. The fund would cover activity-related costs through an existing youth-serving organization. Current resources focus on the Ottawa region, however the YCCF is project that can be applied anywhere.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
