/P 227 0 R
/E (The YCCF is not a housing program, medical service, or a replacement for any existing services. It is intended to supplement existing youth-support services, akin to employment services at youth drop-in centres. The fund would not cover unsafe or discriminatory activities, gambling, or expenses unrelated to community participation. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [9]
>>
