340 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 230 0 R
/E (The project was intentionally out-of-the-box as it focuses on a hidden part of youth homelessness support, being the access to hobbies, recreation, volunteering, arts, education, and skill-building. Instead of proposing only traditional supports like housing or shelters, the YCCF treats community participation as a meaningful part of holistic youth support. Universal design was also considered through broad activity categories, the ability for youth to chose their own activities, enrollment/transportation/equipment support, and provider approval guidelines that emphasize safety, inclusion, accessibility, and belonging. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
