/Title (The Youth Community Connection Fund is a proposed flexible funding initiative that helps youth experiencing housing instability access community-based activities by covering barriers to entry such as fees, transportation, equipment, and supplies.        The primary objective of this fund is to support belonging, confidence, life-skills development, and stronger community connections as youth transition toward an independent adulthood.)
